   535	  must be installed, or `httplib_ROOT` must be set. Defaults to OFF.
   536	
   537	**LLVM_ENABLE_IDE**:BOOL
   538	  Tell the build system that an IDE is being used. This in turn disables the
   539	  creation of certain convenience build system targets, such as the various
   540	  ``install-*`` and ``check-*`` targets, since IDEs don't always deal well with
   541	  a large number of targets. This is usually autodetected, but it can be
   542	  configured manually to explicitly control the generation of those targets.
   543	
   544	**LLVM_ENABLE_LIBCXX**:BOOL
   545	  If the host compiler and linker support the stdlib flag, ``-stdlib=libc++`` is
   546	  passed to invocations of both so that the project is built using libc++
   547	  instead of stdlibc++. Defaults to OFF.
   548	
   549	**LLVM_ENABLE_LIBEDIT**:BOOL
   550	  Controls whether to enable libedit support for command-line editing and history
   551	  in LLVM tools. When ``ON``, forces libedit support to be enabled and will cause a
   552	  CMake configuration error if libedit cannot be found. When ``OFF``, disables
   553	  libedit support entirely. If not specified, LLVM will auto-detect libedit
   554	  availability. Defaults to auto-detection.
   555	
